archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-12-13T21:11:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T15:23:28Z","closed_at":"2026-05-29T13:45:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4 and later with integrated Jolt physics\n- Not reproducible in 4.3 and earlier with Godot-Jolt add-on\nLinux - Godot v4.5.1.stable - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD RX 6600\n\n### System information\n\nLinux - Godot v4.5.1.stable - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD RX 6600\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen integrated Jolt physics is enabled, reparenting a node with `Reparent` will sometimes not respect the default `keepGlobalTransform` and will be teleported to the origin of the new parent.\n\nThis is dependent on a call to `test_move` in `_integrate_forces` at some point, that tests repositioning the parent node, for example:\n\n```\nfunc _integrate_forces(_state: PhysicsDirectBodyState3D) -> void:\n    # ---------------------------\n    # This is the key trigger of the bug - commenting this out, the object\n    # is no longer teleported to the origin on reparent.\n    # ---------------------------\n    test_move(global_transform, Vector3(0, -0.05, 0))\n```\n\n\nThere was a related issue fixed in Godot-Jolt in 2023: https://github.com/godot-jolt/godot-jolt/issues/693 - it seems the code was refactored as it was merged into Godot, so may be a regression or a separate root cause.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* Enable Jolt physics engine\n* Make a 3D scene, and in it a (\"parent\") RigidBody3D node not at the origin\n* Add a RigidBody3D child of the nested node, and reposition it\n* Add a callback from a collision, and in it call `reparent` on the RigidBody3D child to reparent it to the scene root\n* In _integrate_forces, call test_move <-- this is what triggers the bug\n\nExpected: the RigidBody3D global position doesn't change\nActual: the RigidBody3D is teleported to 0,0,0\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMinimal reproduction repo: https://github.com/craethke/GodotJoltReparentTest/tree/main\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"craethke","id":25989829,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTg5ODI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25989829?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke","html_url":"https://github.com/craethke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/craethke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114002/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114002/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}